PLACEHOLDER for Icon128.png

This file is a stand-in. The Epic Fab marketplace + Unreal Editor's
Plugin Browser require a real 128x128 PNG at this path:

    sdk/unreal/SCC/Resources/Icon128.png

The image is a binary asset and is intentionally NOT committed in
source form. Provide the PNG via:

    1. Place a 128x128 RGBA PNG at the path above (replacing this
       placeholder).
    2. The release script (prepare-distribution.sh) verifies the file
       exists and is the correct dimensions before zipping the plugin
       for marketplace submission.

Recommended branding: a simple monochrome glyph -- the marketplace
preview is shown at 64x64 in tile views.
